        ; flash while it is being erased/written -- then ZEROES the RAM copy. Gated by the 4-byte arm magic
        ; set by callers: arm=0x53('S')/0x65('e'), b1=0xAC/0x96, b2=0xCA, b3=0x35. Target flash addr comes
        ; from bl_exec_addr_hi/lo (set by BL_Flash_RunDriverAtAddr).
