; ======== BL_Routine_VerifyAndRunMTOS  (@0x89b78) ========
        ; BL_Routine_VerifyAndRunMTOS - SID 0x31 routine 0xFA handler.
        ; NOT a flash erase. Validates the MTOS image previously uploaded into RAM and launches it:
        ;   1. Compares the uploaded RAM header at mtos_ram_header (0xc00c) against the 6-byte reference
        ;      mtos_signature_ref (flash 0x3fe8); mismatch -> return 2 (reject).
        ;   2. Checks the "MT" (MTOS) magic that follows.
        ;   3. CRC16-checks the RAM image (calculate_crc16_checksum) with DPP0=0x24 paging.
        ;   4. If mtos_entry_ptr (0xc012) == RAM base 0xc000, jumps into the uploaded code via
        ;      MTOS_RamEntry (call to RAM 0xc014). Returns 0 on success, 0xc001 if entry ptr bad, 2 on
        ;      signature/CRC failure.
