; ======== KWP_BL_SID_20_StopDiagnosticSession  (@0x8b68a) ========
        ; KWP2000 SID 0x20 StopDiagnosticSession (bootloader router). Toggles the diag/programming
        ; session-active flag (kwp_comms_flags bit 0x2000). First call (flag clear) ENTERS a
        ; default session: sets P3 timeout=0xffee, clears session-type idx, grants flash-flag
        ; access (KWP_SecAccess_GrantFromFlashFlags), sets bit 0x2000, NRC=0. Subsequent call
        ; (flag set) LEAVES: clears session, clears bits 0x3000 of kwp_comms_flags.
