; ======== KWP_BL_SID_20_StopDiagSession_progB  (@0x8c27c) ========
        ; KWP2000 SID 0x20 StopDiagnosticSession - programming-session-B variant. If session active,
        ; invokes the RAM flash driver (Push_To_System_Stack_Program / BL_FlashDriver_Program at 0x28a0)
        ; to tear down, then BL_FlashDriver_Finalize, clears session bits. Else (re)enters default session:
        ; P3=5000, grants flash-flag access, sets session bit, NRC=0.
