        ; 0x80 -> all records; 0x81 -> dump all ID blocks until terminator 0xFF; else -> match a single
        ; record id. Walks the ID descriptor table (windowed pointers selected by DAT_00fd0a&0x20) and
        ; appends each record via BL_Append_EcuId_Record (FUN_08df3a). NRC 0x12 for unknown id.
